{"id":"168a305dd3d267bf","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-almost-disjoint.md","title":"Almost Disjoint","display":"df-almost-disjoint — Almost Disjoint","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-almost-disjoint","aliases":["58-df-almost-disjoint"],"display":"df-almost-disjoint — Almost Disjoint","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-almost-disjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-almost-disjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-almost-disjoint — Almost Disjoint"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two sets are almost disjoint if their intersection is finite.</li>\n<li>Almost disjoint families are central in set theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)","display":true}],"bytes":764,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ebbc212e82e7872","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-almost-disjoint]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-almost-disjoint.md|58-df-almost-disjoint]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}